  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Casting class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever one of your subordinates would be banished or dispelled, you may spend a spell point as a free action (even outside of your turn) to allow the subordinate to remain for one additional round. Each turn, you may spend an additional spell point to allow them to remain for one additional round.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Card Casting 2: Counters and Control</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc57\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
